
# Functions

## Register

Register a patient for a department and issue the next ticket number.

- Inputs: patient (nat), dept (nat)
- Outputs: ticket (nat)
- Decomposition: Hospital_Register

## Triage

Assign triage priority when a patient arrives, elevating urgent cases.

- Inputs: patient (nat), urgent (nat)
- Outputs: priority (nat)

## AssignDoctor

Assign an on-duty doctor to a waiting patient.

- Inputs: patient (nat), doctor (nat)
- Outputs: assigned (nat)

# Data Resources

## PatientId

Natural-number identifier of a registered patient.

## DoctorId

Natural-number identifier of an on-duty doctor.

## queue

Sequence of waiting patient identifiers.

## waiting_count

Number of patients currently waiting.

# Constraints

## Valid waiting queue

forall[p: queue] | p > 0 and waiting_count >= 0
